e (DOC 10).\n- **Alternative Therapies**: While CDCA remains the standard, other bile acids (e.g., **ursodeoxycholic acid**) or adjunctive therapies (e.g., **cholestyramine**) have been explored but lack robust evidence for primary treatment (DOC 7).\n- **Combination Therapies**: There is **no evidence** supporting combination therapies (e.g., CDCA + statins or LDL apheresis) for CTX, as these do not provide additional benefits (DOC 6).\n\nWould you like further clarification on any specific aspect of CDCA\u2019s mechanism or clinical application?",
