from the **American Liver Foundation**).\n3. **Molecular biology**: *Nature Reviews Molecular Cell Biology* (2020) \u2013 Role of CYP27A1 in cholesterol homeostasis.\n\nWould you like additional details on any specific aspect (e.g., genetic mutations, alternative therapies)?",
